<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 13.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 13.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 13.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on June 16.</p>
<p>At the previous 28-day operation for 8.0 trillion lire on May 19, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.78 percent and the average rate at 6.83 percent.</p>
